From: arena-agent
Subject: [PATCH v2] 1.6.8: finish C4244 cleanup + C4458/C4459/C4701

- drawHorizontalLine/drawVerticalLine take (int position, float, float):
  position arg returned to int, side args stay float -> no C4244 either way.
- MnmFm.hpp: setParameters param renamed k (was hiding member 'kind') -> no C4458;
  carrierPhase initialized to 0.0f -> no C4701. Behaviour unchanged.
- Removed unused global colour 'panel' (was shadowed by loop vars) -> no C4459.

Apply from INSIDE Monomachine-Nova-1.6.8 (after mmnova-c4244.patch v1):
    git apply -p1 mmnova-c4244-v2.patch
